  "cpu_note": "The histogram-omp reference is an OpenMP target-offload program for icpx (absent on rosi_v100); with g++ -fopenmp it falls back to the host and reports INCORRECT, so it is not a usable CPU performance or correctness baseline. CPU correctness is validated against the exact host reference. CPU Host/OmpBlocks throughput at N=2073600 (--repeat 20): uchar1 ~1.0 ms, uchar4 ~1.2 ms, float4 ~1.5 ms (48 threads, shared-machine variation).",
